@xiaopb/dsh-mobile-layout README · 三套布局预设（原生 / 融合 / 悬浮）：三套布局叫**原生 / 融合 / 悬浮**：原生 = DSH 官方原样；融合 = 输入区与底栏连成一整条（v1）；悬浮 = 输入卡浮起 + 五项导航（v2）。切换入口只有一处：**设置 → 通用设置 → 外观下面**的「布局模式」，原生 / 融合 / 悬浮三张卡片（各带迷你线框缩略图），其它页签（模型 / 内置插件）不出现。切换即时生效、三档双向往返不残留，且**插件自带的配置页**（如桌宠配置、插件市场）同样被接管。

- **原生**：整体交还官方布局，只把官方设置弹窗钉成**居中悬浮窗**——左右等宽不掉边、上下各留约 10% 视口高（小屏保底、大屏封顶）；从其它预设切过来时设置页保持打开。**唯一例外**是输入行「附件」入口：一枚回形针按钮，点开就近弹出「选择图片 / 选择文件」，省掉「点 ⊕ → 在指令列表里找上传」那一步。App 内（手机 / 平板、横竖屏、全屏 / 小窗）都出现，桌面端不出现。
- **融合**：输入区与底栏连成一整条；空态虚线输入卡左右留白对称（此前左侧贴边、右侧多 7px，是官方滚动容器的经典滚动条沟槽所致）。

@xiaopb/dsh-mobile-layout README · 安装：```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add @xiaopb/dsh-mobile-layout
```

@xiaopb/dsh-mobile-layout README · Features：- **Sidebar → Drawer**: swipe right from anywhere in the left ~60% of the screen (QQ-style, mid-left start — full-screen gesture phones reserve the hard edge for system back); **finger-following drag with velocity/position snap on release**; tap-mask or left-swipe to close. Gesture is the only entry — no button (so it never covers a sub-page's own back button); the listener lives on `window` in the capture phase and works on every plugin page. Auto-collapses only on real navigation (blank taps, search, account menu, etc. stay open).
- **Bottom action bar**: new / chat / file / image / plugins / more, pinned right above the composer.
- **Add panel**: **reveal / cover transition** against the soft keyboard (content-adaptive height; the keyboard slides over to cover the panel and slides away to reveal it, with the input row position preserved via viewport-jump compensation — no animation crossing); open/close slide animations (skipped automatically for reduce-motion users); a 4×2 icon grid with horizontal paging beyond 8 items; icons are **color-coded by function** (12 soft tints across blue / orange / violet / green — same type keeps the sa
